  "details": "I am part of some VRChat groups that do a lot of announcement posts. I muted the groups so I don't get notifications in VRChat, and this works fine.\n\nHowever, with the android app, I am getting the app push notifications still. If I click one of them it takes me to the VRChatApp's Notification menu, but there is no notification from the group there.\n\nApp version: 2024.2.2p1-1458-9cd1bfadf5-Release\n\nEDIT: On closer observation, it actually looks like I am ONLY getting app push notifications from groups that I have muted. Groups that I don't have muted seem to never make app push notifications. I assume there is an issue with a Boolean inversion?",
